      "text": "This first application has been filed by applicant under Section 483 of BNSS, 2023 for grant of bail in connection with Crime No.291/2024 registered at Police Station-Khachrod, District Ujjain(M.P.)\nfor offence punishable under Sections 294, 323, 366-A, 376(2)(n) of IPC and Section 5(L)/6 of POCSO Act, 2012.",
