      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28729814291000366
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "In her statement recorded under Section 161 and 164 of Cr.P.C., the victim alleged that NEUTRAL CITATION NO.\n2025:MPHC-IND:810 2 MCRC-53180-2024 accused Gopal had threatened to kill her family members and forcefully taken her and her sister to Nagda Railway Station.",
